@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo"
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Open1 : starts.due
Open1 --> Water1 : age >= 2s
Water1 --> Stop1 : age >= 5min
Stop1 --> Idle : age >= 2s

Idle : 밸브 꺼짐, 펌프 꺼짐
Open1 : 밸브 켜짐, 펌프 꺼짐
Water1 : 밸브 켜짐, 펌프 켜짐
Stop1 : 밸브 켜짐, 펌프 꺼짐
@enduml
